{
  "description": "Issue #7 without GPS/compass: follows the fixed route in nav_cores.h (river, reverse, 3 homesteads, depot) by dead reckoning. GO = mission travelling (mission-fsm DRV and state is en-route). Pivot to face the next point, then drive straight. L/R (-1..1) go to l298n-drive with UPD every evaluation. Pulses RIV / HOM / DEP go to mission-fsm ARIV / AHOM / ADEP. SPD = m/s and TRN = deg/s at the drive duties (calibrate on your ground). EXEC = 1 when the drive is really moving (0 while inhibited).",
